  "goodToKnow": "Herzhaft means hearty: herzhaft lachen, gähnen, zubeißen (bite heartily). For food it means savoury, as opposed to süß: herzhaftes Gebäck, ein herzhaftes Frühstück with bread, cheese and sausage. Don't confuse it with herzlich (warm, cordial): herzliche Grüße, herzlich willkommen. A herzhafte Brotzeit is a typical Bavarian snack."
